  "body": "Is is often really helpful to select a subject precisely (to apply an effect only to the subject, or to remove the subject from the another mask etc), and is done in so many lightroom tutorials that I feel a bit lost when using any open-source software (see e.g. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FMaB03h1rQk). Would it be possible to add an AI-masking tool in ART? Some possible implementations details are discussed in darktable (https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable/issues/12295) that mention, e.g., Segment Anything https://segment-anything.com/, https://github.com/danielgatis/rembg , SAM2, FAST-SAM, Mobile SAM…",
